# xbuild's runtime_libs folder for arm64-v8a (crates/rustudio-android/manifest.yaml):
# tools/android/fetch-turnip.sh puts libadrenotools.so, its hook libraries and
# libvulkan_freedreno.so (the Turnip driver) here before `x build`. The .so
# files are git-ignored; an empty folder builds a plain APK.
